  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "3 pints fresh strawberries",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "2.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "4 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.33333334326744 cup shortening",
    "1 egg",
    "3/4 cup half-and-half",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract, divided",
    "2 cups whipped heavy cream",
    "1/4 cup powdered sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bFs2ZRm7PdWrE1yO8EfodxerPAU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-568901-3x4-8bb05496804b4c5d983f32d2bbec678b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Grease an 8-inch cake pan with butter and lightly dust with flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the strawberries and toss them with 1/3 cup of white sugar. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/967PTj-BuvSL-AnFu2d1FC5xN3Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-5746-02-B-3x4-5824e82c51484358a164ae6446e57a4a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, 1/4 cup of white sugar, baking powder, and salt in a medium bowl; cut in butter with a pastry blender or two knives until mixture resembles coarse crumbs. Make a well in the center of mixture; add beaten egg, half-and-half, and 1 teaspoon vanilla. Stir mixture until just combined and no dry spots remain, being careful not to overmix.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6nYIn0Kwig0lyhn-H_5ijNWzUKA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-569003-3x4-efddcda4842346028742e7ce432f1636.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter evenly into prepared cake pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9h--N-I7h3t5cndf_069kMucXWo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-569204-3x4-01a53abacfcd49ee9e04aaf88579f7dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the cake comes out clean and top is golden brown, about 18 minutes. Let cool partially in cake pan, about 10 minutes. Flip cake onto a clean work surface.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y6uSASDcEJy3K3MSsIa21Mq6TXA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-5741-05-3x4-194da5e0bd1f45f1893ad445ea1360fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, beat heavy cream, powdered sugar, and remaining 1 teaspoon vanilla with an electric mixer on medium-high speed until soft peaks form, about 3 minutes. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y0AsT0sNfuOf_PEv5o3PKIuTfAs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-5748-06-3x4-f8a9d852eb544757a3c207906631afea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut partially cooled cake in half horizontally, making 2 layers; set top layer aside. Drain reserved strawberries in a colander placed over a small bowl, reserving any juice. Brush strawberry juice evenly over top of bottom cake layer. Evenly arrange ½ of the drained strawberries over bottom layer of cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/g728KsF6zvTGI9E3Pi5vCD5o7BY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-5751-07-3x4-a837b7a918cc461e9fd102c635a10801.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread ½ of whipped cream evenly over strawberries; place top cake layer over whipped cream. Top with remaining strawberries and whipped cream.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OP9DES7HJnqvsA9QtzTWmGKi0T4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-5754-08-3x4-af5c28f49ec341829d34bd52eb0bf017.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0kfzN0CBam7vTnAnWXpvoFIY2e8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8201-strawberry-shortcake-ddmfs-5775-hero-3x4-47272b202c594de0a4221f3a7cab4087.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8201/step_10.webp"
    }
  ],
